********************************Python file architecture******************************************
Main.py   # Integrate the extract dxf function and generate shapes_summary.xlsx for the next step.
- extract_dxf_v2.py   # Extract dxf files by ezdxf
- plot_v2.py
analyze_origin.py   # Extract the dimention layer of shapes_summary.xlsx and find the origin of the new LF coordinate, and also transform the vacuum cups coordinate to the new LF coordinate.
mapping.py   # Map the vacuum cups on the Lead Frame layers, visualize it and show to the user.
dxf_diagnosis.py   # Display the ammounts of vacuum cups, and also display the middlepoint of the LF and all shapes in LF DXF file. 

********************** How to find the origin of Lead Frame ****************************

1.  According to the obeservation, I found that if the length of the dimention line is not too small
    (2mm for temporaily thershold), the actual dimention length will be measured from MAX(delta x, delta y).
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.  I'll take the ShapeID B0C92FD for example, the two defpoints are (726.0998915586204, 285.2546000935866) 
    and (696.9093473114067, 463.2546000935867), delta x=|726.09989-696.909347|=29.19 and 
    delta y=|285.254-463254|=178 , since the delta y is bigger than delta x, delta y will be 
    represents as y length. 
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3.  Continue operate the same action and we can find the largest delta x and largest delta y, 
    which represents the total length and width respectively. 
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4.  Then I'll find midpoint of the largest delta x and largest delta y and their intersection point 
    will be the origin point of the Lead Frame drawing, and I'll create a new coordinate system with it.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

********************************* Next Step ********************************************

1.  I have the .xlsx which contains the actual vacuum cups location (mm for unit), since the scale of the 
    Lead Frame is 1:2, so that the dimention of the LF is actually twice of the actual length(mm for unit).
    So I need to times two of the vacuum cups coordinate to match the scale.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.  Then I'll transform their coordinates to the actual location in the DXF drawing, for example, if the
    vacuum cupA is on (43.75, -17.5), then according to the scale transform, the new coordinate of cupA will
    be (87.5, -35). The next step will be transform to actual location, if the origin of the LF is at 
    (450, 500), then vacuum cupA's coordinate will be (450+87.5, 500-35)=(537.5, 465).
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3.  找到每個INSERT對應的block name -> 取出block definition (doc.blocks[block_name]) -> 對block內容每個幾何物件做
    矩陣運算(平移、旋轉、縮放) -> 用matplotlib畫出所有線段、多邊形、圓等。

3.a Instead of using the vectorization method, I found it more instinct by plotting selected layer of LF
    drawing by matplot, and draw the vacuum cups on it.

4.  

